                                "example_id": "ddb74d71-5aa1-472a-a902-51ee98930ac0",
                                "sense_id": "32b2bee9-15a9-3bf5-bda2-639045a1cc8e",
                                "text": "But at the microlevel it consists of an unimaginable number of atoms connected by springy chemical bonds, all jiggling around at a rate that even our fastest supercomputer might envy."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0bc00b8-4fa4-4b5a-821d-23f79a373616",
                                "sense_id": "32b2bee9-15a9-3bf5-bda2-639045a1cc8e",
                                "text": "Popular slogans and a bucket of paint / Supercomputer on a jolly crusade"
